'''Lianorm Swamp'''<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> was a [[swamp]] on the [[planet]] [[Naboo]] close to [[Lake Paonga]].<ref name="TPM" /> It spread over an area of 85 square kilometers.<ref name="AEYNTK" /> During the [[Invasion of Naboo]], the [[Jedi Master]] [[Qui-Gon Jinn]] and his [[Padawan]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] encountered the [[Gungan]] [[Exile (punishment)|exile]] [[Jar Jar Binks]] while fleeing from the forces of the [[Trade Federation]].<ref name="TPM" />

